    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is proud to present 7 Willomere to the market.\r\n\r\nThis spacious three-bedroom duplex property sits within a small, well-kept development adjacent Redford Park in Greystones. The property extends to approximately 120.8 m² and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThe layout works well for modern living. A bright first floor has direct access to a private balcony off the kitchen/dining area, and the living room is bright and well-proportioned with a feature stone fireplace and inset stove.\r\n\r\nThe balcony to the rear overlooks mature trees with glimpses of Bray Head. Also on this level is a third bedroom, currently set up as a home office, enjoying views of the balcony and grounds beyond.\r\n\r\nThe top floor offers two generous double bedrooms. The main bedroom has its own en-suite and two Velux windows that bring in plenty of natural light.\r\nThe second bedroom has full-height fitted sliding wardrobes and a dormer window with beautiful sea views. The ideal space for a reading nook.\r\nA family bathroom, large walk in hotpress and storage room, and a landing complete this floor.\r\n\r\nLocated just a short stroll from the Blacklion Shopping Centre and surrounding amenities, the property is also within easy reach of Greystones Town and the harbour marina.\r\nThe property also offers convenient access to public transport links, including bus routes and the N11 & M50 road networks.\r\n\r\nThere are a host of sports and leisure clubs in the area, including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis, and GAA. The Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool are nearby, as is a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Delgany, Greystones, Powerscourt, and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nWillomere is situated in a stunning location close to the coast and the Wicklow Mountains, with easy access to local beaches, countryside, and the nearby villages of Delgany and Kilcoole.\r\n\r\nInternal viewing of this property is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nTiled flooring, carpeted stairs to landing, under-stair storage capacity, feature arched window, attic access. \r\n\r\nUpper Hallway\r\nAlarm, Intercom, under-stairs storage, carpeted stairs to landing. \r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nLaminated wood flooring, recessed lighting, inset stove fireplace with sandstone mantle, stone inset, and stone hearth. Overlooking amenity green to front and the off-street parking provided. Views of Greystones coastline.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room \r\nTiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, stainless steel sink unit, extractor fan, ample countertops, integrated appliances polished black granite countertops, recessed lighting, Gas hob. Overlooking private balcony and beautiful views of Redford Cemetery.\r\n\r\nBalcony\r\nOverlooking Bray head and Redford Cemetery, additional block-built storage shed, solid timber decking. \r\n\r\nLanding\r\nLaminated wood flooring, hot press/storage room off, attic access, smoke alarm, exterior light box.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nFully tiled room, fully tiled bath with glazed shower door and electric Triton T90 shower, pedestal wash basin, WC, 1 x Velux window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLaminate Wood flooring. 2 x Velux Windows.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nTiled flooring, part tiled walls, fully tiled shower with electric Mira shower, wash hand basin, WC, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nLaminate wood flooring, floor to ceiling sliderobes, recessed lighting, bay window with stunning sea and country views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 / Office\r\nLaminate wood flooring, overlooking private balcony and Bray Head. \r\n\r\nSPECIAL FEATURES\r\nHighly sought after location\r\nEnviable 'B' BER rating\r\nEnd of terrace Duplex\r\nSea and countryside views\r\nTastefully decorated and beautifully maintained throughout\r\nPrivate balcony to rear\r\nvisitor and resident parking\r\nSpacious entrance hall suitable for additional storage \r\nWell proportioned rooms\r\nAmple natural light\r\nWalking distance to local schools, shops and restaurants\r\nWalking distance to Greystones town centre and Marina\r\nEasy access to commuter routes N11/M50\r\n\r\n*Management fees: €1,472.62 includes maintenance of communal areas/ garden and central sinking fund."
      },
